\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  Striving onward, pressing forward,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Life divine to gain.
\par I will ever make endeavour
\par Till I it attain.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par What detains, I'll cast aside,
\par By that promise to abide!
\par Who endureth life secureth
\par And the prize shall gain.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  I am hasting, time not wasting,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 To the Father's throne.
\par For delaying in obeying
\par Can but harm God's own.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par He who strives but tires in strife,
\par he does forfeit crown and life.
\par Wordly pleasure holds no treasure,
\par I wish naught of this.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.  Jesus guiding all my striving
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Ever to the goal.
\par Should I waver, then O Saviour,
\par Strengthen then my soul.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par When temptation comes to me
\par And from scorn and taunt I flee,
\par Let then mercy love uplift me;
\par I'll triumphant be.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li360\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Thou must draw me, Lord, I can't be
\par \pard\li360\sl190\slmult0 Ever strong enough.
\par Where I'm failing, I'll be gaining
\par Strength from Thee above.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Whilst Thy word brings life to me
\par And Thy spirit sets me free,
\par Salem's glories rise before me,
\par \pard      May I enter in.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

